  - key: hud.card.blood_debt.name
    value: Kan Borcu
    en: Blood Debt
  - key: hud.card.blood_debt.boon
    value: "T\xFCm hasar +%35"
    en: All damage +35%
  - key: hud.card.blood_debt.curse
    value: Maksimum can -%30
    en: Max health -30%
  - key: hud.card.blood_debt.flavor
    value: Kule borcunu etinden tahsil eder.
    en: The tower collects its due in flesh.
  - key: hud.card.starving_steel.name
    value: "A\xE7 \xC7elik"
    en: Starving Steel
  - key: hud.card.starving_steel.boon
    value: "B\u0131\xE7ak hasar\u0131 +%50, Kan Hasad\u0131 iki kat iyile\u015Ftirir"
    en: Blade damage +50%, Blood Harvest heals double
  - key: hud.card.starving_steel.curse
    value: "D\xFC\u015Fmanlar can k\xFCresi d\xFC\u015F\xFCrmez"
    en: Enemies drop no health orbs
  - key: hud.card.starving_steel.flavor
    value: "\xC7elik doymad\u0131k\xE7a sen de doymazs\u0131n."
    en: While the steel hungers, so do you.
  - key: hud.card.last_breath.name
    value: Son Nefes
    en: Last Breath
  - key: hud.card.last_breath.boon
    value: "Can yar\u0131n\u0131n alt\u0131ndayken hasar +%60, h\u0131z +%20"
    en: 'Below half health: damage +60%, speed +20%'
  - key: hud.card.last_breath.curse
    value: "T\xFCm iyile\u015Fmeler -%50"
    en: All healing -50%
  - key: hud.card.last_breath.flavor
    value: "\xD6l\xFCm yakla\u015Ft\u0131k\xE7a elin a\u011F\u0131rla\u015F\u0131r."
    en: The nearer death comes, the heavier your hand.
  - key: hud.card.bone_wings.name
    value: Kemik Kanatlar
    en: Bone Wings
  - key: hud.card.bone_wings.boon
    value: "Dash %40 h\u0131zl\u0131 dolar, h\u0131z +%15"
    en: Dash recharges 40% faster, speed +15%
  - key: hud.card.bone_wings.curse
    value: "Al\u0131nan hasar +%25"
    en: Damage taken +25%
  - key: hud.card.bone_wings.flavor
    value: "Hafif kemik \xE7abuk k\u0131r\u0131l\u0131r."
    en: Light bones break fast.
  - key: hud.card.brimming_chalice.name
    value: Dolu Kadeh
    en: Brimming Chalice
  - key: hud.card.brimming_chalice.boon
    value: "Fazla can s\u0131n\u0131r\u0131 +50; fazla can varken at\u0131\u015F
      h\u0131z\u0131 +%35"
    en: Overheal cap +50; while overhealed, fire rate +35%
  - key: hud.card.brimming_chalice.curse
    value: "Can yar\u0131n\u0131n alt\u0131ndayken h\u0131z -%20"
    en: 'Below half health: speed -20%'
  - key: hud.card.brimming_chalice.flavor
    value: Kadeh doluyken herkes cesurdur.
    en: Everyone is brave while the cup is full.
  - key: hud.card.glutton_barrel.name
    value: Obur Namlu
    en: Glutton's Barrel
  - key: hud.card.glutton_barrel.boon
    value: "At\u0131\u015F h\u0131z\u0131 +%40"
    en: Fire rate +40%
  - key: hud.card.glutton_barrel.curse
    value: Toplanan cephane -%50
    en: Ammo pickups -50%
  - key: hud.card.glutton_barrel.flavor
    value: "\xC7abuk yer, a\xE7 kal\u0131r."
    en: It eats fast and starves faster.
  - key: hud.card.strip.title
    value: KARTLAR
    en: CARDS
  - key: hud.card.rarity.common
    value: SIRADAN
    en: COMMON
  - key: hud.card.rarity.rare
    value: "NAD\u0130R"
    en: RARE
  - key: hud.card.rarity.relic
    value: "KAD\u0130M"
    en: RELIC
  - key: hud.card.iron_hide.name
    value: Demir Post
    en: Iron Hide
  - key: hud.card.iron_hide.boon
    value: "Al\u0131nan hasar -%20"
    en: Damage taken -20%
  - key: hud.card.iron_hide.curse
    value: "H\u0131z -%10"
    en: Speed -10%
  - key: hud.card.iron_hide.flavor
    value: "Z\u0131rh etine kaynar, ad\u0131m\u0131n a\u011F\u0131rla\u015F\u0131r."
    en: Armor fuses to flesh, and every step grows heavy.
  - key: hud.card.carrion_crow.name
    value: "Le\u015F Kargas\u0131"
    en: Carrion Crow
  - key: hud.card.carrion_crow.boon
    value: Toplanan cephane +%75
    en: Ammo pickups +75%
  - key: hud.card.carrion_crow.curse
    value: "Can k\xFCresi \u015Fans\u0131 -%25"
    en: Health orb chance -25%
  - key: hud.card.carrion_crow.flavor
    value: "Karga diriyi de\u011Fil, geride kalan\u0131 besler."
    en: The crow feeds not the living, but what is left behind.
  - key: hud.card.pilgrims_flask.name
    value: "Hac\u0131 Mataras\u0131"
    en: Pilgrim's Flask
  - key: hud.card.pilgrims_flask.boon
    value: "\u0130yile\u015Fmeler +%35, can k\xFCresi \u015Fans\u0131 +%50"
    en: Healing +35%, health orb chance +50%
  - key: hud.card.pilgrims_flask.curse
    value: "At\u0131\u015F h\u0131z\u0131 -%12"
    en: Fire rate -12%
  - key: hud.card.pilgrims_flask.flavor
    value: "Her yudum can verir, her dua eli yava\u015Flat\u0131r."
    en: Every sip mends the flesh, every prayer slows the hand.
  - key: hud.card.gilded_vein.name
    value: "Yald\u0131zl\u0131 Damar"
    en: Gilded Vein
  - key: hud.card.gilded_vein.boon
    value: "Fazla can s\u0131n\u0131r\u0131 +50; fazla can varken al\u0131nan hasar
      -%25"
    en: Overheal cap +50; while overhealed, damage taken -25%
  - key: hud.card.gilded_vein.curse
    value: Maksimum can -%20
    en: Max health -20%
  - key: hud.card.gilded_vein.flavor
    value: "Alt\u0131n damarlar\u0131 korur ama kalbi daralt\u0131r."
    en: Gold shields the veins, yet narrows the heart.
  - key: hud.card.executioners_oath.name
    value: Cellat Yemini
    en: Executioner's Oath
  - key: hud.card.executioners_oath.boon
    value: "B\u0131\xE7ak hasar\u0131 +%75, dash %25 h\u0131zl\u0131 dolar"
    en: Blade damage +75%, dash recharges 25% faster
  - key: hud.card.executioners_oath.curse
    value: "T\xFCm hasar -%20"
    en: All damage -20%
  - key: hud.card.executioners_oath.flavor
    value: "Yemin yaln\u0131zca yak\u0131ndan vurana sad\u0131kt\u0131r."
    en: The oath keeps faith only with those who strike up close.
  - key: hud.card.bell_tower.name
    value: "\xC7an Kulesi"
    en: Bell Tower
  - key: hud.card.bell_tower.boon
    value: "At\u0131\u015F h\u0131z\u0131 +%50, al\u0131nan hasar -%20"
    en: Fire rate +50%, damage taken -20%
  - key: hud.card.bell_tower.curse
    value: "H\u0131z -%15, dash %20 yava\u015F dolar"
    en: Speed -15%, dash recharges 20% slower
  - key: hud.card.bell_tower.flavor
    value: "Tun\xE7 \xE7an\u0131n alt\u0131nda duran e\u011Filmez ama k\u0131p\u0131rdayamaz."
    en: Who stands beneath the bronze bell never bends, yet barely moves.
  - key: hud.card.judges_scale.name
    value: "Yarg\u0131\xE7 Terazisi"
    en: Judge's Scale
  - key: hud.card.judges_scale.boon
    value: "T\xFCm hasar +%60"
    en: All damage +60%
  - key: hud.card.judges_scale.curse
    value: "Al\u0131nan hasar +%40"
    en: Damage taken +40%
  - key: hud.card.judges_scale.flavor
    value: Terazi iki kefeyi de kanla tartar.
    en: The scale weighs both pans in blood.
  - key: hud.card.hollow_saint.name
    value: Oyuk Aziz
    en: Hollow Saint
  - key: hud.card.hollow_saint.boon
    value: "Dash %60 h\u0131zl\u0131 dolar, h\u0131z +%25"
    en: Dash recharges 60% faster, speed +25%
  - key: hud.card.hollow_saint.curse
    value: Maksimum can -%25
    en: Max health -25%
  - key: hud.card.hollow_saint.flavor
    value: "Kemiklerinden bo\u015Falan her gram r\xFCzg\xE2ra d\xF6n\xFC\u015F\xFCr."
    en: Every ounce hollowed from the bone turns to wind.
  - key: hud.card.red_hour.name
    value: "K\u0131z\u0131l Saat"
    en: Red Hour
  - key: hud.card.red_hour.boon
    value: "At\u0131\u015F h\u0131z\u0131 +%50, b\u0131\xE7ak hasar\u0131 +%50, h\u0131z
      +%15"
    en: Fire rate +50%, blade damage +50%, speed +15%
  - key: hud.card.red_hour.curse
    value: "\u0130yile\u015Fmeler -%25, can k\xFCresi \u015Fans\u0131 -%50"
    en: Healing -25%, health orb chance -50%
  - key: hud.card.red_hour.flavor
    value: "K\u0131z\u0131l saatte merhamet kurur, yaln\u0131zca k\u0131y\u0131m
      kal\u0131r."
    en: In the red hour mercy dries up, leaving only slaughter.
